activity Conduct Risk Assessment
activity Develop Compliance Plan
activity Approve Compliance Plan
activity Implement Controls
activity Train Employees
activity Monitor Compliance
activity Report Violation
activity Investigate Violation
activity Take Corrective Action
activity Review Compliance Plan
bind Conduct Risk Assessment: Risk Level, Assessment Score
bind Develop Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Approve Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Implement Controls: Control Types
bind Train Employees: Training Hours
bind Monitor Compliance: Compliance Status, Number of Violations
bind Report Violation: Violation Severity
bind Investigate Violation: Financial Impact
bind Take Corrective Action: 
bind Review Compliance Plan: Plan Status
Risk Level: High, Medium, Low
Assessment Score: integer between 0 and 100
Plan Status: Approved, Pending, Reviewed
Compliance Status: Compliant, Non-Compliant
Violation Severity: Low, Medium, High
Financial Impact: float between 0.0 and 1000000.0
Control Types: Technical, Administrative, Physical
Training Hours: integer between 1 and 100
Number of Violations: integer between 0 and 100
Init[Conduct Risk Assessment] | |
Response[Develop Compliance Plan, Approve Compliance Plan] | | |
Response[Approve Compliance Plan, Implement Controls] | | |
Response[Approve Compliance Plan, Train Employees] | | |
Response[Implement Controls, Monitor Compliance] | | |
Response[Report Violation, Investigate Violation] | | |
Response[Investigate Violation, Take Corrective Action] | | |
Existence[Train Employees] | |
Alternate Succession[Approve Compliance Plan, Review Compliance Plan] | | |
Response[Conduct Risk Assessment, Implement Controls] |A.Risk Level is High | |0,30,d
Response[Monitor Compliance, Take Corrective Action] |A.Compliance Status is Non-Compliant | |0,7,d
Response[Monitor Compliance, Review Compliance Plan] |A.Number of Violations > 5 | |0,14,d
Response[Investigate Violation, Review Compliance Plan] |A.Financial Impact > 10000 | |0,3,d